<REAPER_PROJECT 0.1 "7.84/linux-x86_64" 1793982143 0
  <NOTES 0 2
    Walk-To-Novotel take01: stereo ref vs AmbiX field.
    Track 1 plays the stereo render, exactly as monitored live.
    Track 2 (muted) holds the 4ch AmbiX file through a JS stereo
    fold-down so it plays on speakers now. For true headphone 3D:
    install IEM BinauralDecoder (free, plugins.iem.at), insert it
    after the JSFX on track 2, bypass the JSFX, unmute track 2 and
    mute track 1.
  >
